abstract: >-
    SRS Lipid Droplet StarDist is a StarDist-based image-analysis workflow
    for automated instance segmentation and quantitative analysis of lipid
    droplets in stimulated Raman scattering microscopy images. The workflow
    supports individual lipid-droplet detection, counting, area measurement,
    size analysis, batch processing, segmentation-mask export, and
    quantitative data export.
